      "code": "const Lookup<GlyphID> &lookup = subs[entry->data.markIndex];",
      "role": "root_cause",
      "note": "The substitution table offset at markIndex resolves to a null offset (0), which returns the global Null(Lookup<GlyphID>) object. No runtime check prevents using this null Lookup for a get_value call."
