      "role": "sink",
      "note": "get_value dispatches to LookupFormat0 on the 2-byte Null(Lookup) global buffer. The format field reads as 0, and arrayZ[glyph_id] reads past the end of the 2-byte global Null buffer, causing a global-buffer-overflow READ."
